# `**/` matters: a bare `node_modules` matches only the repository root, and
# nested workspace symlinks (absolute host paths) would otherwise be copied
# over the image's own install and break every resolution inside it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/data
.git
.github
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal
.env
.env.local
**/.vite
